{"3908400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Invasia", "steam_appid": 3908400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi. Horror. Space station. A crushing sense of isolation, interrupted by creatures that make you wish you were alone again. And the thunderous footsteps of a heavily armored protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/b12a746d6f27159a56d2c2b2d63abb98.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/b12a746d6f27159a56d2c2b2d63abb98.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/b12a746d6f27159a56d2c2b2d63abb98.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all of that makes you nostalgic for 2008, you're not the only one. Invasia is a third-person sci-fi horror experience that plunges you into a long, grim, and mystery-driven journey aboard a space station overrun by hostile... humans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/ab070595469ca8ee5345c6b0a49e68ec.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/ab070595469ca8ee5345c6b0a49e68ec.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/ab070595469ca8ee5345c6b0a49e68ec.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decay within and without</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your first instinct when facing cosmic beasts is to blow off their limbs, Invasia has a surprise waiting for you. These monsters are more than just infected. Something lurks inside them, something that can attack through every limb at once. Worse still, it doesn't even need a host body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/5b351b9239c7126d21c542dcbc9fc6fa.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/5b351b9239c7126d21c542dcbc9fc6fa.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/5b351b9239c7126d21c542dcbc9fc6fa.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But monsters are only part of the problem. They are clumsy, primitive, and unable to use firearms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the station's corridors are littered with human corpses riddled with bullet wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the creatures didn't do it... who did?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/c7e27431fd473c5f856fc0f9bb9361c7.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/c7e27431fd473c5f856fc0f9bb9361c7.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/c7e27431fd473c5f856fc0f9bb9361c7.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Psychological and body horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasia brings a new take to space horror. The danger comes from everywhere: from outsiders, from within, from humanity’s own hands and from an unknown new threat. Will you dare face what you can not understand?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All answers await at the game’s finale. Coming soon.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/4d5555362c68a404df017293796bb9d6.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/4d5555362c68a404df017293796bb9d6.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/4d5555362c68a404df017293796bb9d6.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi. Horror. Space station. A crushing sense of isolation, interrupted by creatures that make you wish you were alone again. And the thunderous footsteps of a heavily armored protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/b12a746d6f27159a56d2c2b2d63abb98.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/b12a746d6f27159a56d2c2b2d63abb98.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/b12a746d6f27159a56d2c2b2d63abb98.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If all of that makes you nostalgic for 2008, you're not the only one. Invasia is a third-person sci-fi horror experience that plunges you into a long, grim, and mystery-driven journey aboard a space station overrun by hostile... humans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/ab070595469ca8ee5345c6b0a49e68ec.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/ab070595469ca8ee5345c6b0a49e68ec.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/ab070595469ca8ee5345c6b0a49e68ec.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decay within and without</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your first instinct when facing cosmic beasts is to blow off their limbs, Invasia has a surprise waiting for you. These monsters are more than just infected. Something lurks inside them, something that can attack through every limb at once. Worse still, it doesn't even need a host body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/5b351b9239c7126d21c542dcbc9fc6fa.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/5b351b9239c7126d21c542dcbc9fc6fa.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/5b351b9239c7126d21c542dcbc9fc6fa.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But monsters are only part of the problem. They are clumsy, primitive, and unable to use firearms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the station's corridors are littered with human corpses riddled with bullet wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the creatures didn't do it... who did?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/c7e27431fd473c5f856fc0f9bb9361c7.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/c7e27431fd473c5f856fc0f9bb9361c7.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/c7e27431fd473c5f856fc0f9bb9361c7.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Psychological and body horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasia brings a new take to space horror. The danger comes from everywhere: from outsiders, from within, from humanity’s own hands and from an unknown new threat. Will you dare face what you can not understand?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >All answers await at the game’s finale. Coming soon.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/4d5555362c68a404df017293796bb9d6.poster.avif?t=1787773125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/4d5555362c68a404df017293796bb9d6.webm?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/extras/4d5555362c68a404df017293796bb9d6.mp4?t=1787773125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Invasia is a project for those who miss Sci-Fi horror games, but featuring cutting-edge visuals. You wake up alone to the distant wail of sirens. The bright corridors of the space station are gone, replaced by claustrophobic darkness. Something has gone dreadfully wrong.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/c928a18b8ad363774180151447877fab412bbfa2/header.jpg?t=1787773125", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/3f5c24b3f7b8f51f8b6d1cd20b6a9f350970ff3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787773125", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908400/3f5c24b3f7b8f51f8b6d1cd20b6a9f350970ff3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787773125", "website": "https://rocat.games", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 2600x, Core i5 8600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 5700, GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 50GB SATA SSD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X,Core i5 11600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon RX 6700 XT, Geforce RTX 2070<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "drm